{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The Breeze and I Still Do feel like natural next choices because Old Sock gives me a direct connection to Clapton, and familiar blues guitar is what I want now.",
    "10 Days Out fits my interest in blues, while In-A-Gadda-Da-Vida connects with my Hendrix listening, even though neither would displace my two Clapton choices today."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "The Lovin' Spoonful collection and Blackstar do not fit my current blues and roots-rock mood; being familiar rock names is not enough to make me choose them.",
    "Altamira's soundtrack focus is less appealing than a song-based album, and I cannot establish a relevant connection from titles such as Alone or The Complete Hit Singles."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "My interest in some older rock artists seems to have been extended too broadly to music with a different sound or mood.",
    "My interaction with Blown Away offers some reason to suggest country, but it does not mean country is what I want during this visit."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "The direct connection to Clapton matters more to my choices today than a broad connection to rock music.",
    "An album can fit my interests without making me want to choose it now; I would select only the strongest matches and leave other appealing blues or psychedelic records for later."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations recognize my blues and classic-rock interests, but sometimes stretch those connections beyond the familiar blues listening I want today."
}"}
